                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 border border-gray-200"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gray-400"></span> Inactivo</span>
